# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore (context is the repo root — see Dockerfile).
# The build reads word-addin/, frontend/src/shared, frontend/public/icons and
# packages/contracts; everything else stays out of the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.open-next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
backend
desktop
docs
e2e
word-addin/e2e
word-addin/e2e-live
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
